    "updated_at": "2023-08-18T09:03:18Z",
    "body": "> The obvious way to resolve this is to use `<h1>` for the name of the website, `<h2>` for the title of the article, and downgrade all those sections headings within the article to `<h3>`.\r\n\r\nThis is the way to go, as far as I know.\r\n\r\nPerhaps we should clarify that more. #8070 also asked about this I think.",
